bounce  # Rise and fall\n\nprint(total_distance)\n```\n```output\n58.0\n```\nThe total distance traveled by the ball when it hits the ground for the third time is \\(\\boxed{58}\\) meters.", 'Let $x$ be the number of digits in $2014^{2014}$.  Find $x$. \\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed{} \\n\n\\boxed